Branding Requirement:
Deployments not operated by or on behalf of Taostats must remove all
Taostats branding (name, logo, favicon, and Open Graph images) from
user-facing authentication pages. Retaining Taostats branding implies
that Taostats operates or endorses the service, which misleads users
about the trust relationship.

